omments/323206137","html_url":"https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js/issues/11969#issuecomment-323206137","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/11969","id":323206137,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDMyMzIwNjEzNw==","user":{"login":"vanruesc","id":9214917,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyMTQ5MTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9214917?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vanruesc","html_url":"https://github.com/vanruesc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vanruesc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vanruesc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vanruesc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vanruesc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vanruesc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vanruesc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vanruesc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vanruesc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vanruesc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-08-17T21:59:46Z","updated_at":"2017-08-17T21:59:46Z","body":"The main camera's aspect ratio is never copied to the mirror camera.\r\n\r\n```js\r\n// \"examples/Mirror.js\" (lines 142-146)\r\nmirrorCamera.near = camera.near;\r\nmirrorCamera.far = camera.far;\r\nmirrorCamera.updateMatrixWorld();\r\nmirrorCamera.updateProjectionMatrix();\r\n```\r\n\r\nShould be changed to:\r\n\r\n```js\r\nmirrorCamera.updateMatrixWorld();\r\nmirrorCamera.projectionMatrix.copy(camera.projectionMatrix);\r\n```\r\n\r\nI'll send a PR for this later!\r\n\r\nAnother problem with the mirror (and the planar ocean) is that it doesn't seem to work when the```logarithmicDepthBuffer``` is enabled. Oblique near plane clipping messes with depth and I never found a solution for this. I wish WebGL had ```glClipPlane``` 😞 ","aut